'''Snowflake''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it for 3,000 [[Snowflake Tokens (2017)|Snowflake Tokens]] {{Currency|Snowflake Token 2017}} through Santa’s Workshop during the [[Christmas Event 2017|2017 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is made up of a large, jagged icy blue icicle. The guard is made out of a hexagon shaped snowflake with six dendrites protruding out from it, hence the name. The thin handle, connected to the snowflake, is blue in color with an icy gemstone pommel attached to the bottom of it.

==Trivia==
*Its model derives from the sword included in the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/583157224/Snowflake-Shield-and-Sword Snowflake Shield and Sword], purchasable from the avatar shop for 750 Robux.
*This, along with [[Frostsaber]], were the only purchasable [[Godly Weapons|godlies]] during the [[Christmas Event 2017|2017 Christmas Event]].
*When salvaged, it provides 10 godly [[shards]]. 

